---
const reqs = [
  {
    n: '01',
    title: 'Attend all live classes — or watch the replays.',
    body:
      "The full arc of the course matters. Every class builds on the last. If life pulls you away from a live session, the replay is enough — the manual is enough — but the material needs to be received.",
  },
  {
    n: '02',
    title: 'Participate in some of the online practice sessions.',
    body:
      "You don't certify by reading. You certify by sounding, by holding space, by being held. The hosted practice sessions are where this happens.",
  },
  {
    n: '03',
    title: 'Record and submit one video where you demonstrate working with someone.',
    body:
      'A real session, with a real person. You facilitate. You hold space. You send it to Jacob, and he gives you feedback.',
  },
];
---

<section class="cc-cert" id="certification">
  <div class="cc-cert-inner">
    <div class="cc-cert-head">
      <div class="cc-eyebrow cc-eyebrow--center">Becoming a certified practitioner</div>
      <h2 class="cc-h2" style="margin-top: var(--sp-4); max-width: 26ch; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
        The certificate is a doorway. <em>Three requirements to walk through.</em>
      </h2>
      <p class="cc-cert-lead">
        The certificate is the door — into your own practice, into integrating
        Somatic Vocal Healing with the work you already do, into a community
        of practitioners holding this work in the world.
      </p>
      <p class="cc-cert-lead">
        Jacob's own words: “I'm a self-taught, self-certified man. Who am I
        to say you need a certificate?” The certificate isn't permission.
        It's a record that you walked the path — and a door for those who
        want one.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="cc-cert-reqs">
      {reqs.map((r) => (
        <div class="cc-cert-req">
          <div class="cc-cert-req-num">{r.n}</div>
          <div>
            <h3>{r.title}</h3>
            <p>{r.body}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <p class="cc-cert-foot">— Three requirements. Each one a natural part of walking the path. —</p>
  </div>
</section>
